    "   (or use its Ashtakoot table directly if entering nakshatras).",
    "3. Copy the obtained points for each of the 8 kootas, the total, and whether Nadi/Bhakoot",
    "   dosha is present-and-not-cancelled into 'expected', then set status to FILLED.",
    "",
    "Cases with status != FILLED are SKIPPED (not failed). Once FILLED, a mismatch FAILS the",
    "build and tells you exactly which provisional table cell to correct (see VERIFICATION.md).",
